      "inventory_sha256": "1858c992ef1e9a6b842e6b7d36b1e30b8abe0e686374e68b1766d4f9cb1e3824",
      "module": "VERIFICATION",
      "normalized_sha256": "ea9bd944c022c45e91082fb836fb1130b2cd059d0798ab09baa25e9067fe1c06",
      "rationale": "Adds an unproved backward-fold simplification for primeTail under a nonzero previous divisor.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-ea9bd944c022c45e91082fb836fb1130b2cd059d0798ab09baa25e9067fe1c06",
      "start_line": 138,
      "text": "  rule primeTail(N:Int, D:Int) => primeTail(N, D -Int 1)\n    requires D >Int 2\n      andBool D <=Int N\n      andBool pyMod(N, D -Int 1) =/=Int 0\n    [symbolic(N, D), simplification]"
