+| 10 | 82–84 | `rule-22fa1e67d4a05b75b5a578312159b0a4e049b756806628df2540b007f43bcb5d` | DOMAIN_LEMMA | Reverse cast/projection bridge; a proof shortcut, not the primary definition. |
