  ✓ Reconstruct and independently classify the Stage 3 rule inventory
  ✓ Authenticate producers and audit deterministic Stage 4 obligations/target
  ✓ Fresh-build Stage 5, audit target/axioms, and test operational bridges
  ✓ Consolidate raw evidence and write REVIEW.md with the final pair
